java
int[] nums = {1, 2, 3};
List<Integer> list = Arrays.stream(nums).boxed().collect(Collectors.toList());

Arrays.stream(nums) turns the int[] into an IntStream, .boxed() converts each primitive int → Integer, and .collect(Collectors.toList()) gathers them into a proper List<Integer>.


